    "id": "關鍵試驗",
    "html": "<figure class=\"figblk\" id=\"fig-breast-neoadjuvant-trials\"><div class=\"figwrap\"><section class=\"fig dense\">\n\n  <table class=\"fig-tbl fill\">\n    <caption>Randomised evidence behind each box of the escalation table</caption>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"lab\" style=\"width:150px\">Setting</th>\n        <th class=\"lab\" style=\"width:180px\">Trial</th>\n        <th class=\"lab\" style=\"width:440px\">Population and comparison</th>\n        <th style=\"width:290px\">Key result</th>\n        <th class=\"alt\">What it changed</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"grp\">TNBC</th>\n        <td class=\"em\">KEYNOTE-522</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Early TNBC &middot; preoperative chemotherapy <b>&plusmn; pembrolizumab</b>, pembrolizumab continued after surgery</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Higher pCR, EFS significantly improved</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">The source of both pembrolizumab boxes &mdash; and of the rule that it must have been given preoperatively</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"grp\" rowspan=\"2\">HER2-negative,<br>residual disease</th>\n        <td class=\"em\">CREATE-X</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">HER2-negative with residual disease after preoperative chemotherapy &middot; observation <b>vs</b> capecitabine</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">DFS and OS both improved</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Capecitabine 6&ndash;8 cycles for residual TNBC</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"em\">OlympiA</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Germline <i>BRCA1/2</i>, high-risk HER2-negative early breast cancer &middot; placebo <b>vs</b> olaparib for one year</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">iDFS and OS both improved</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Olaparib (category 1) in the residual boxes of HR+/HER2&minus; and TNBC</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"grp\" rowspan=\"3\">HER2-positive</th>\n        <td class=\"em\">KATHERINE</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">HER2-positive with residual invasive disease after preoperative therapy &middot; trastuzumab <b>vs</b> T-DM1</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">iDFS significantly improved</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">The prototype of &ldquo;residual disease means switching to an ADC&rdquo;</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"em\">DESTINY-Breast05</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">HER2-positive with residual disease after preoperative therapy &middot; T-DM1 <b>vs</b> T-DXd</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">iDFS superior to T-DM1</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">v6.2026 lists T-DXd before T-DM1, limited to <b>high risk of recurrence</b></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"em\">APHINITY</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">HER2-positive early breast cancer &middot; chemotherapy + trastuzumab <b>&plusmn; pertuzumab</b></td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Benefit for preventing recurrence confirmed at 11.3 years median follow-up</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Cited in the BINV-16 footnote, behind pertuzumab + trastuzumab when node positive at initial staging</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"grp\">HR+/HER2&minus;</th>\n        <td class=\"em\">monarchE<br>NATALEE</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">High-risk early HR+/HER2&minus; disease &middot; endocrine therapy <b>&plusmn;</b> a CDK4/6 inhibitor (abemaciclib; ribociclib)</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">iDFS improved</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">&ldquo;Consider ribociclib&rdquo; in the pCR box, &ldquo;consider abemaciclib or ribociclib&rdquo; in the residual box; eligibility on BINV-K</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"grp\">Local therapy</th>\n        <td class=\"em\">NSABP B-51</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">cN1 converting to ypN0 on preoperative therapy &middot; with <b>vs</b> without RNI / PMRT</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Follow-up limited; long-term non-inferiority not demonstrated in this subgroup</td>\n        <td class=\"left\">Why BINV-14 says &ldquo;not routinely indicated&rdquo; and still asks for the undertreatment discussion</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"fig-foot\">\n      This table is editorial annotation &mdash; NCCN lists regimens and evidence categories, not trials.\n      APHINITY and NSABP B-51 are the only two written into the BINV-16 and BINV-14 footnotes.\n  </div>\n\n</section></div><figcaption><span class=\"figt\">Trials behind preoperative therapy and postoperative escalation</span><button class=\"figcite\" data-fig=\"breast/neoadjuvant-trials\" type=\"button\">複製引用</button><a class=\"figdl\" href=\"/figures/breast%2Fneoadjuvant-trials.png\" download>下載 PNG</a></figcaption></figure><div class=\"tblwrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>試驗</th><th>族群</th><th>比較</th><th>結果</th><th>改變了什麼</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>KEYNOTE-522</b></td><td>早期 TNBC</td><td>術前化療 <b>± pembrolizumab</b>，術後續用 pembrolizumab</td><td>pCR 提高、EFS 顯著改善</td><td><a class=\"refl\" href=\"/preview/breast?page=29\" title=\"BINV-16・第 29 頁\"><span class=\"refc\">BINV-16</span></a> 裡 TNBC 兩格 pembrolizumab 的來源，也是「術前有給才能術後給」這個前提的由來</td></tr><tr><td><b>CREATE-X</b></td><td>HER2-negative、術前化療後有殘留病灶</td><td>觀察 <b>vs capecitabine</b></td><td>DFS 與 OS 均改善</td><td>TNBC 殘留病灶的 capecitabine 6–8 cycles</td></tr><tr><td><b>OlympiA</b></td><td>germline BRCA1/2、高風險 HER2-negative 早期乳癌</td><td>安慰劑 <b>vs olaparib 一年</b></td><td>iDFS 與 OS 均改善</td><td>HR+/HER2− 與 TNBC 兩列殘留格裡的 olaparib（category 1）</td></tr><tr><td><b>KATHERINE</b></td><td>HER2-positive、術前治療後有 residual invasive disease</td><td>trastuzumab <b>vs T-DM1</b></td><td>iDFS 顯著改善</td><td>「殘留就換 ADC」這個概念的原型</td></tr><tr><td><b>DESTINY-Breast05</b></td><td>HER2-positive、術前治療後有殘留病灶</td><td>T-DM1 <b>vs T-DXd</b></td><td>iDFS 優於 T-DM1</td><td>NCCN 6.2026 把 T-DXd 寫在 T-DM1 前面，並限定「high risk of recurrence」</td></tr><tr><td><b>APHINITY</b></td><td>HER2-positive 早期乳癌</td><td>化療 + trastuzumab <b>± pertuzumab</b></td><td>中位追蹤 11.3 年確認預防復發的效益</td><td>直接被引在 <a class=\"refl\" href=\"/preview/breast?page=29\" title=\"BINV-16・第 29 頁\"><span class=\"refc\">BINV-16</span></a> 的註腳裡，支撐「初始分期淋巴結陽性者用 pertuzumab + trastuzumab」</td></tr><tr><td><b>NSABP B-51</b></td><td>cN1 經術前治療轉成 ypN0</td><td>加或不加 RNI／PMRT</td><td>追蹤期有限，未能對這個次族群證明長期非劣性</td><td><a class=\"refl\" href=\"/preview/breast?page=27\" title=\"BINV-14・第 27 頁\"><span class=\"refc\">BINV-14</span></a> 因此寫「不常規建議」，同時要求把治療不足的風險攤開來談</td></tr><tr><td><b>monarchE</b>（abemaciclib）、<b>NATALEE</b>（ribociclib）</td><td>HR+/HER2− 高風險早期乳癌</td><td>內分泌治療 ± CDK4/6 抑制劑</td><td>iDFS 改善</td><td><a class=\"refl\" href=\"/preview/breast?page=29\" title=\"BINV-16・第 29 頁\"><span class=\"refc\">BINV-16</span></a> 裡的 “consider ribociclib”（pCR 格）與 “consider abemaciclib or ribociclib”（殘留格）；資格條件在 BINV-K</td></tr></tbody></table></div><blockquote>這張表是策展補充，不在 NCCN 原文頁面上。NCCN 只列方案與證據等級，APHINITY 與 NSABP B-51 是唯二被寫進 <a class=\"refl\" href=\"/preview/breast?page=29\" title=\"BINV-16・第 29 頁\"><span class=\"refc\">BINV-16</span></a>／<a class=\"refl\" href=\"/preview/breast?page=27\" title=\"BINV-14・第 27 頁\"><span class=\"refc\">BINV-14</span></a> 註腳的試驗。</blockquote><hr class=\"sep\">"
